{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaunts Gambit is a multiplayer first person shooter game. Set in an abandoned school left empty because of a rampant virus,\u00a0former students sneak back in fighting over control of the grounds and buildings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2v2 TeamMatch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FFA</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2V2 TEAMMATCH:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are divided into two teams of two, where they battle  for their team in a singular building. The team with the most kills wins the match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZOMBIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players face waves of zombies, barricading entrances to slow them down. Survive as long as possible against the increasing difficulty!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FFA:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players compete solo in a battle for the highest kill count before the timer runs out. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430480?t=1760365252","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430480?t=1760365252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430480/7c641e27f94ac97537e93bad9f82134e5b0894b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760365252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430480/7c641e27f94ac97537e93bad9f82134e5b0894b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760365252","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features mild blood effects and large blood stains when players are eliminated. There is no gore; the blood effects are not fully realistic.\r\n\r\nThe visual style is not hyper-realistic. Mature content is presented in a comical, and unserious manner.\r\n\r\nThe game contains frequent strong language, appearing in 60% of voice lines.\r\n\r\nThe main map is set in an abandoned school building that has been unused for years. This setting has no correlation to real-life tragedies. We do not endorse such disgraceful acts in any way. Neither the game nor we have any association with such events."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaunts Gambit is a multiplayer first person shooter game. Set in an abandoned school left empty because of a rampant virus,\u00a0former students sneak back in fighting over control of the grounds and buildings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2v2 TeamMatch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FFA</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2V2 TEAMMATCH:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are divided into two teams of two, where they battle  for their team in a singular building. The team with the most kills wins the match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ZOMBIES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players face waves of zombies, barricading entrances to slow them down. Survive as long as possible against the increasing difficulty!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FFA:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players compete solo in a battle for the highest kill count before the timer runs out. </p>","developers":["Filip Siennicki"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id"